  "Question": "Without changing the value of the algebraic fraction, multiply both the numerator and denominator of \\((0.2x+0.5)/(0.3x-0.1)\\) by 10 to obtain \\((ax+5)/(bx-1)\\). What is \\(a+b\\)?",
